From a suitably privileged account (ie. the SYSTEM account):

$ ANALYZE/SYSTEM
SDA> CLUE CONFIG
SDA> EXIT

$ SHOW DEVICE D 
Will show you disk drives.

Anything else?  Report back here with specific questions.

